{"version": 0.6, "generator": "Overpass API 0.7.62.11 87bfad18", "osm3s": {"timestamp_osm_base": "2026-11-01T08:54:04Z", "copyright": "The data included in this document is from www.openstreetmap.org. The data is made available under ODbL."}, "elements": [{"type": "node", "id": 2363155664, "lat": 29.8064948, "lon": 99.6068119, "tags": {"alt_name:en": "Ge'nyen Massif", "alt_name:zh": "格聂神山;格聂圣山;格聂多吉巴尊;岗波贡嘎;岗波圣地;呷玛日巴;岗波格聂多吉贝寨", "description": "岗波:藏语中译意为眼睛,是说进入岗放圣地,人们目不忍睹,两眼应接不暇,也表示佛经中智慧和方便大乐。从此,人们就称它为“岗波乃郎”(意为岗波圣地)。藏文史书上故又称“岗波刚热”(意为岗波雪岭)，据《智者喜宴》记载,主峰岗波格聂多吉贝寨是岗波圣地之主或圣地之护法神，又是佛教二千零二十名佛陀的施主。后来,人们又把岗波格聂多吉贝寨简称为格聂圣山,格聂,居士之意,据说是一位骑着白马身穿白色战袍的英俊山神。格聂山,又称岗波贡嘎。在藏语中则有贡波雪峰之意。", "ele": "6204", "name": "格聂峰", "name:bo": "དགེ་གཉེར་གནས་རི།", "name:en": "Mount Genyen", "name:zh": "格聂峰", "name:zh-Latn-pinyin": "Gê'nyên", "natural": "peak", "prominence": "1994", "source": "cyclemap", "source:prominence": "6204-4210 (Col at the G215 road close to Lajiacun Niuchang)", "wikipedia": "en:Ge'nyen Massif"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 2363156400, "lat": 29.8283619, "lon": 99.5518229, "tags": {"alt_name:zh": "霞兄", "ele": "5458", "name": "霞穷", "name:en": "Xiaqiong", "name:zh": "霞穷", "natural": "peak", "source": "cyclemap"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 2363156410, "lat": 29.8852924, "lon": 99.5115091, "tags": {"ele": "5681", "name": "泽登罢拉", "natural": "peak", "source": "cyclemap"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 2363156438, "lat": 30.0287435, "lon": 99.5765929, "tags": {"ele": "5561", "name": "Hari", "natural": "peak", "source": "Nakamura"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 3016292309, "lat": 30.2118863, "lon": 99.2487779, "tags": {"name": "拉纳山", "name:en": "Lana Mountain", "name:zh": "拉纳山", "natural": "peak"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 3818704883, "lat": 28.7716219, "lon": 97.7383547, "tags": {"ele": "5525", "name": "乐龙雪山", "natural": "peak", "source": "cyclemap"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 3830582737, "lat": 29.8469069, "lon": 99.6420264, "tags": {"alt_name:zh": "肖扎雪山;肖扎神山;肖扎扎纳", "description": "意为灰黑色的神山", "ele": "5807", "